    "specPath": "specs/213-the-cargo-group-moves-the-vet-records/spec.md",
    "status": "draft",
    "summary": "Dependabot's cargo group (#537) moved `serde-saphyr` and `granit-parser` to 2.2.0, `tree-sitter` to 0.27.2, and `clap`, `clap_derive`, `syn`, `proc-macro2` and `quote` by patch releases. It merged without moving the `cargo vet` records, so `cargo vet --locked` refused eight crates and the required `supply-chain` job failed on `main` and on every pull request. It also moved the exact `serde-saphyr` pin spec 205 asserts, so 205's acceptance failed at its first command. This spec moves the exemptions, refreshes the imported audits, and carries 205's acceptance at 2.2.0.\n",
    "title": "The cargo group moves the vet records and 205's pin"
